            "review_title": "Review at Kintan Dining & Bar",
            "review_text": "LISA PEARCE\n7 contributions\n0\nExceptional fresh produce cooked at your table with friendly smile…\nMay 2026 • Couples\nMyself and my partner called on the off chance, so glad we did. Food was lovely and everything was fresh, the service was exceptional. We weren’t made to feel rushed. Resturant was very clean and all staff greeted us with a smile and were very polite. Value for money. And to top it off they had ice-cold beer on draught.\nWritten May 23, 2026",
            "rating": 4.0,
