            "review_title": "Review at Kintan Dining & Bar",
            "review_text": "Aleksandr\n350 contributions\n0\nHigh-quality meat in Nha Trang\nMar 2026 • Friends\nI visited KINTAN restaurant yesterday and had a very pleasant experience. The restaurant is perfectly located right in the city center, on the first coastline, directly facing the sea, which adds a special charm to the place.\nThe atmosphere inside is welcoming and comfortable, with clean tables and a well-maintained interior. There are plenty of staff members, and the service was excellent — the waiters were polite, attentive, and able to communicate well in English.\nThe main highlight of this restaurant is Wagyu beef. The quality is truly impressive and definitely stands out. While the price is relatively high for Nha Trang, it is justified by the quality of the meat. On average, the cost per person for Wagyu is around 1,000,000 VND, excluding drinks such as alcohol or wine. Of course, it can be slightly higher or lower depending on your choice.\nOne of the best parts is that the meat can be cooked right in front of you, which makes the experience even more enjoyable. The quality and taste are genuinely excellent.\nRead more\nWritten March 19, 2026",
            "rating": 4.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
