            "review_text": "Paul R\n4 contributions\n0\nAmazing Japanese restaurant\nDec 2025 • Family\nHad an amazing evening. The best japenese restaurant we have ever experienced. Staff and food 10/10. We have been in Nha Trang for 3 nights and decided we wanted a steak night. This was so much more than we had envisioned. This kind of food back in the UK would have been the kind of price we couldn't afford. We would definitely cone back again and highly recommend\nRead more\nWritten December 6, 2025",
